extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LLkkOBFUEP0Q7kNvwHxR82R&_nc_oc=AdoTMAOkYfjb75N5ZNLB5b8rGXvwfnf-QqleYkx90N30h08tt81llRPwIEQw1kusFU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIcBERANeYdZKdHV_f-9JGPaN8_D7x3Wag70NutQrp-OQ&oe=6AB7E2D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kXVzhHCueoQQ7kNvwECo15a&_nc_oc=Adri-t6XmMisxzriKKhSfIG5Obp6xuCZTWP9_vlMddvk6_MKVevKUviMtcjeIGxOtZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKFoVj9aYHArbKqH2OVCNrO740xHWuGJjKpoDZ0tu6bnA&oe=6AB7EA22"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XHcjAUIWdtwQ7kNvwHhIMmy&_nc_oc=AdrZdQxJz8hD09VZMQ8PnrD6Wg-lC94Jbcn2W9IM7R7YNRbHZh3lhw1p6r8jhXLz53E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIO3RoKUef9roSoZq2n_XWU_b0D_XNcE8JvmtL5WKTcBQ&oe=6AB7B9D9"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":